    <string name="help_welcome_title">Welcome to Currency Converter</string>
    <string name="help_body">• Converter: Tap the amount (default 1) to open the keypad. Use + − × ÷, share the result, and see a banner if rates are offline or stale. Other currencies lists favorites first, then the full catalog.\n\n• Rates: Live rates for your base currency, with daily percent change. Star favorites. Set a rate alert from any row (Android 13+ will ask for notification permission).\n\n• Alerts: List, edit, or delete alerts. A one-shot alert turns off after it fires; repeating alerts stay on. Tap a notification to open that pair in the converter.\n\n• Statistics: Daily change versus yesterday, quoted in the same base as Rates.\n\n• History: Drag the chart to inspect a date, see the range percent change, and compare a second pair.\n\n• Metals: Gold, silver, platinum, and palladium in your Rates base.\n\n• Widget: Choose quote currency and up to four rates in Settings. Resize for 1, 2, or 4 rows. Tap a row to open the converter for that pair.\n\n• Settings: Language, theme, favorites, widget, updates, and privacy.\n\nOpen screens from the menu at the top left. Live rates come from ExchangeRate-API. Historical charts use Frankfurter (ECB). Data is cached on your device.</string>
